I would like to add my flame about doors, the new "feature"
in Nethack3.0.  They really are a pain in the neck.  They
really have no use except to slow the game down drastically.
Of course you close them to keep out the monsters, but I'd
really be interested in knowing who has ever used them for
that purpose.

Another thing I've noticed in the game that I don't like
is when you have to kick open a door. If you hit the wrong
key and kick in the wrong direction, you are instantly crip-
pled!  It hasn't happened to me yet, but I'd really hate to be
running from a Dragon and accidently cripple myself until the
beastie could devour me!!

One last minor annoyance is that jackels are now `d' and come in
packs, which makes it very difficult to tell your dog apart from the 
jackels in a crowded room.

Other than that I really think the game is great, and salute all
those who have worked on the game.

